Provenance: fetched 2026-08-26 from the 0intro/plan9 mirror
(https://github.com/0intro/plan9, master), the same mirror this repository's
research cites for the system call table. The vendored set spans
sys/include (the real libc.h, bio.h, regexp.h, fcall.h, ctype.h, String.h),
sys/src/libc (port, fmt, 9sys), libbio, libregexp, libString, and
sys/src/cmd (the commands, grep's grammar included); the exact byte-for-byte
contents are recorded by this repository's git history, whose first import
carried per-file sha256 for cat.c and echo.c and whose later imports are
each a single reviewed commit.

The include/ directory beside this notice is NOT Plan 9 source: u.h there is
this project's platform shim (types, varargs, USED/SET — the layer Plan 9
itself keeps per-architecture), beneath the REAL /sys/include/libc.h.

